OL,3,GNEWSATransgender surgery halted over
OL,4,Aconcerns patients were not properly
OL,5,Aassessed
OL,6,
OL,7,FGender-affirming surgery was halted
OL,8,Fbecause of concerns from an NHS
OL,9,Fcommittee over whether patients had
OL,10,Fbeen "appropriately assessed".
OL,12,FAfter meeting Welsh government
OL,13,Fministers on Friday the NHS Wales Joint
OL,14,FCommissioning Committee (NWJCC) said
OL,15,Fdata showed the rate of surgery
OL,16,Freferrals made by the Welsh Gender
OL,17,FService was "significantly higher" than
OL,18,Fin England.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,439,430,260,140,0,100
