OL,3,GNEWSATransgender surgery halted over
OL,4,Aconcerns patients were not properly
OL,5,Aassessed
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt also said the proportion of Welsh
OL,8,Fpatients progressing from referral for
OL,9,Fsome types of surgery was
OL,10,F"significantly lower" than across the
OL,11,Fborder.
OL,13,FThe NWJCC is the body which instructed
OL,14,FCardiff and Vale University Health
OL,15,FBoard to halt new referrals and planned
OL,16,Fsurgeries.
